{
  "server": "tw",
  "storyId": "main_13_level_main_13-04_beg",
  "groupId": "main_13",
  "stageId": "main_13-04",
  "title": "苦厄盤桓",
  "storyCode": "13-5",
  "avgTag": "行動前",
  "sourcePath": "../../vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/obt/main/level_main_13-04_beg.txt",
  "sourceHash": "297d9f62a588626109c3a493a21cf86db50b778557438fe474f5a86f90c8cea5",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_black"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "34_g2_reedmarshes"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Logos",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1072_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這裡的環境讓人很不安，博士，我們之前還在一片密林中。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Logos",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1072_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "隨著霧氣漸濃，我們眼前的景色已然迥異。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Logos",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1072_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "一片……河谷。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "這些東西都是幻覺嗎，Logos？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Logos",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1072_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "幻象自虛無中來，它們只是人腦中虛構的景色，就算再逼真也只會被歸為虛假。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Logos",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1072_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "而這裡不是。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Logos",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1072_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這裡的所有東西，都曾經真實地存在過。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Logos",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1072_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "構築這樣一個，“幻境”，不僅需要情報與訊息，甚至需要，時間與空間。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Logos",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1072_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這太困難。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "骨哨聲？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Logos",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1072_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "是的，女妖們的骨哨。未必有源石技藝的意味。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Logos",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1072_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我們還小的時候，會在河邊練習骨哨，我們會坐在草叢中，靜靜等待。直到小蟲被大鱗吞下，直到大鱗被羽獸捉起。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Logos",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1072_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "骨哨聲就會在此時鳴響。"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "這裡為什麼會有這樣的景色？我們怎麼才能離開？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Logos",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1072_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我在嘗試。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Logos",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1072_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這種並非源石技藝的力量，只可能與更加古老的力量有關。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Logos",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1072_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但它不該出現在這片戰場上，出現在倫蒂尼姆的周邊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿斯卡綸",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_395_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "所有的聲音和場景都很難分辨真假，我們這支隊伍的狀態不好，必須提高警惕。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Logos",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1072_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……母親。"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Logos，怎麼了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Logos",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1072_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……沒什麼。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Logos",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1072_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嘗試直接撕裂這片景色吧，這有些風險，但卻是最好的方法。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Logos",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1072_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我不知道離開這裡是否安全，阿斯卡綸。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "34_g2_reedmarshes"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Logos",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1071_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我明天就會出發，前往巴別塔。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "女妖",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1071_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "女妖",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1071_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你已經是女妖王庭的主人，記得向特蕾西婭殿下帶去我的問候。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Logos",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1071_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這一切還是沒有真實感，母親。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Logos",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1071_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "作為王庭之主，我太過年輕了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "女妖",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1071_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哎呀，怎麼會呢，你的傑出有目共睹。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "女妖",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1071_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "收好。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Logos",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1071_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這是……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "女妖",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1071_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你的骨哨，我為它調了律，加上了王庭的徽記。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "女妖",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1071_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "當然，還有一個充滿魔力的吻。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Logos",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1071_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……嗯。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "女妖",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1071_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "只要骨哨聲響起，所有薩卡茲都會知道，這是喪鐘的意志。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Logos",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1071_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Logos",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1071_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "母親，女妖之主應該做什麼？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "女妖",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1071_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "做你認為必須做的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Logos",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1071_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我曾和您談起過我的那些……瘋話。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Logos",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1071_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "被束縛的薩卡茲沒有出路，就如同您曾經送給我的編織項鍊，結果只有破碎一途。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Logos",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1071_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "而束縛我們的，正是我們的身份，我們的所屬。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Logos",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1071_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "“王庭”，也許還有，“魔王”。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "女妖",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1071_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Logos",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1071_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "可您還是把這個身份交給了我。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "女妖",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1071_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "滅亡的終點一旦抵達，腐朽的軀骸就永不可能再度甦生。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "女妖",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1071_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但……這就是規律。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "女妖",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1071_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我們為一切鳴響喪鐘，為他人，也為自己。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "女妖",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1071_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但這是要肩負責任的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "女妖",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1071_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "倘若你覺得我們古老的傳承早已成為新生的墊腳石，你就應該去親自確認。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "女妖",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1071_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "倘若你沒有改變你的看法——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "女妖",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1071_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "——“新生從滅亡中來”。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Logos",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1071_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……呼。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "女妖",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1071_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哎呀，真不賴。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "女妖",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1071_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "小小的新任女妖之主啊，您第一首稚嫩的喪鐘為誰而鳴？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Logos",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1071_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……為我自己。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Logos",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1071_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "為所有過去和未來將要腐朽的王庭。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "34_g2_reedmarshes"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Logos",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1072_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Logos",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1072_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "“停滯的景觀有何意義？”"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "43_g8_wildernesswarcircle"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿斯卡綸",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_395_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這是……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Logos",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1072_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "血魔的巫術。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Logos",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1072_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但血魔無法營造出剛才的景觀，恐怕還有別的存在在幫助他。"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "血魔想用這些法陣做什麼？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Logos",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1072_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這裡的迴路並不完整，但是……有幾個可被閱讀的象徵。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Logos",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1072_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "“純化”。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Logos",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1072_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……它想對我們的血脈產生影響。對薩卡茲的血脈。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Logos",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1072_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這種術式……與薩卡茲的力量有關。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": "avg_4071_peper_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嘿！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿斯卡綸",
      "speakerId": "avg_4071_peper_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "等等！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": "avg_4071_peper_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我就說，他們是真的！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "明椒",
      "speakerId": "avg_4071_peper_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那些鬼魂是真的！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "你是……"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "明椒",
      "speakerId": "avg_4071_peper_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "呃……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "明椒",
      "speakerId": "avg_4071_peper_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你是那個，“博士”？我在海布里區的軍工廠看見過你！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "明椒",
      "speakerId": "avg_4071_peper_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你怎麼會在這裡？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "明椒",
      "speakerId": "avg_4071_peper_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "還有一個昏迷的卡特斯，和……薩卡茲？"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "在諾伯特區，你為難民們提供了物資。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "明椒",
      "speakerId": "avg_4071_peper_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你怎麼知道！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "明椒",
      "speakerId": "avg_4071_peper_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "別、別亂說！我只是，呃——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "明椒",
      "speakerId": "avg_4071_peper_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這位卡特斯小姐的狀態好像不太好？你的胳膊也……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "明椒",
      "speakerId": "avg_4071_peper_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你們，呃，你們跟薩卡茲在一起，應該……沒什麼問題吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "疲憊的薩卡茲",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_935_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我們好像回到原來的地方了，但這次是真的嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "兇狠的薩卡茲",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_054",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我不想再看見頂著光環的怪獸了，根本沒道理。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "疲憊的薩卡茲",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_935_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "明椒，你怎麼在跟那些鬼魂說話？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "兇狠的薩卡茲",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_054",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "一個……戴著兜帽的人，一隻昏迷的兔子，還有個薩卡茲？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "明椒",
      "speakerId": "avg_4071_peper_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不是！司機小姐，他們是真的！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“司機”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_935_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "真的？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Logos",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1072_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你好。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“司機”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_935_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗚哇！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“司機”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_935_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "礦工，你也來看看，果然是真的！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“礦工”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_054",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你……你這身衣服，挺值錢對吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "精明的薩卡茲",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_932_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你再仔細看看！算了，你這種烏薩斯來的鄉巴佬怎麼會懂。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“礦工”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_054",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "老財，別每次把自己說得像是什麼卡茲戴爾的大人物，你不過是在那有家雜貨店而已！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“礦工”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_054",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哦，我忘了，你還把你的店賣了，就為了來這裡找架打，哈！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“老財”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_932_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "放尊重點！別在他面前造次！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“老財”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_932_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "您好，哈哈……您也許在卡茲戴爾見過我，我的雜貨店還算有點名氣……"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“老財”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_932_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "您是……王庭的成員，對吧？我認得您這身衣服……您是，土石之子？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Logos",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1072_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……我是女妖。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“司機”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_935_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "男性女妖？女妖不基本都是女性嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Logos",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1072_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "是的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“司機”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_935_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "呼，我在卡西米爾可從來沒聽說過男女妖……呃，我是不是太失禮了……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“司機”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_935_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "明椒，你居然認識這種大人物？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "明椒",
      "speakerId": "avg_4071_peper_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……不、不算認識吧……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Logos",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1072_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你們在運貨？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Logos",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1072_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你們要把這些物資運去哪裡？這些好像是儀式的材料？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "明椒",
      "speakerId": "avg_4071_peper_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "呃……我不知道該怎麼說，我們只是跟著路線圖巡查，有些法陣會有點損壞，我們就要修好它們。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "尊貴的女妖大人，我們這樣不可能活著穿越戰場，求求你乾脆讓我們解脫吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Logos",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1072_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Logos",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1072_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Logos",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1072_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你們的運輸隊被我徵用了。我們正在執行極其特殊的任務，卻在路上遇到了襲擊，你們的協助將會被我銘記。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“老財”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_932_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哈哈，能夠為王庭成員服務是我們的榮幸，閣下！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“老財”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_932_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "就是……被報喪女妖銘記……總覺得不太吉利。能不能……"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Logos",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1072_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這是報酬。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“老財”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_932_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哈哈，感謝老爺！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "明椒",
      "speakerId": "avg_4071_peper_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "可我們的運輸任務……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Logos",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1072_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "事後我會向你的上級說明。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“礦工”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_054",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "特殊任務？為什麼會帶著這兩個異族人？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Logos",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1072_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……他們是我的俘虜。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "明椒",
      "speakerId": "avg_4071_peper_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "俘虜？可是，你們……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "明椒",
      "speakerId": "avg_4071_peper_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "明椒",
      "speakerId": "avg_4071_peper_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "好吧……但結束之後，你們要和我一起去見曼弗雷德將軍。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "明椒",
      "speakerId": "avg_4071_peper_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我們先去整理幾個位置出來。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Logos，想辦法分一輛車給阿斯卡綸。\n赦罪師的襲擊並不單純，他們與血魔一起行動，但卻把阿米婭帶離了那條船。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Logos",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1072_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "博士，你在擔心？"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "可露希爾和自救軍的隊伍中沒有適合的戰鬥人員，凱爾希受了傷，閃靈很強大，但赦罪師一定為她單獨準備了手段。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Logos",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1072_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……我明白了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "阿米婭的狀態恐怕不是藥物所能治癒的，她現在更需要的，是在醒來之前，不再落入赦罪師們的視線之中。\n藉助這支小隊行動，反而會更安全。\n我會讓阿斯卡綸支援凱爾希，這裡有你在。\n況且……"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Logos",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1072_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這些結晶……不是簡單的源石。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ],
